// A box and a point in screen points, y down: what the ARWES ports
// (frames.coax, fx.coax) and Aethyr's HUD (aethyr/ui/hud.coax) measure in.
// They live here so a component can load the ports without loading Aethyr.

HudBox :: struct { x:f32; y:f32; width:f32; height:f32; }
HudCoord :: struct { x:f32; y:f32; }
